  "ruleText": "He-W 606.76 Resources - Basic Principles. If excluded resources have been commingled with countable resources, the individual shall provide proof of the portion that is excluded.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #6531, INTERIM, eff 6-27-97, EXPIRES: 10-25-97; ss by #6614, eff 10-24-97; ss by #8452, eff 10-22-05; ss by #10471, eff 11-26-13; ss by #13875, eff 2-21-24",
